\f0\b \cf0 Application and Recognition Basics
\f1\b0 \
Credit recognition typically requires submission within the first academic year, focusing on equivalence in learning outcomes rather than exact credit matches. Applications involve official transcripts, module descriptions (in English or German), and grading schemes\'97submit via email to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:recognitions-in.asa@xcit.tum.de?referrer=grok.com"}}{\fldrslt \cf3 \ul \ulc3 \strokec3 recognitions-in.asa@xcit.tum.de}} with standardized naming. Deadlines align with semester ends, and decisions come from module supervisors or the examination board within 4-6 weeks.\

